rows.statement:
The causal classes: the null cone $\{Q_{
u}=0\}$ ($\p^{3}-\p^{2}+\p$ points) and the two classes of non-null vectors by the square class of $Q_{
u}(v)$, $(\p-1)(\p^{3}+\p)/2$ each, partition $\Fp^{4}$ and are invariant under $O(Q_{
u},\Fp)$ and under rescaling: the shell's null, timelike and spacelike separation ($\p=5$, $13$ exhaustive).

