rows.statement:
The family $\Lambda(u)$, $u=\g^{\Delta m}\in\Fpx$: $\gamma=(u+u^{-1})/2\in\Fp$ but $a=(u-u^{-1})/(2c)\in c\Fp$, outside $\Fp$ for $u
eq\pm1$; it preserves $Q_{
u}$ over $K$, where $Q_{
u}$ is Euclidean; the $\p-1$ matrices form the split torus of $SO(Q_{
u},K)$ --- the extension's rotations, not the shell's boosts ($13$, $17$ exhaustive).

